TELETEXT NAVIGATOR 1.7.1 (Win x64)
Retro internet client of The Teletext:
RIPscrip, an ANSI BBS with Zmodem, NABU,
Videotex (Minitel and NAPLPS), Web 1.0,
Gopher, ARPANET mail, WAIS, Archie, FTP,
Newsgroups, IRC, CU-SeeMe, Telnet, GW-BASIC.
New in 1.7.1: updates install by themselves.
http://www.teletext.ca
Help in WinHelp. AGPLv3. (c) The Teletext
